You focus your senses, getting information from moments in the future.

Improves your capacity to see invisible foes by [+25, +34, +41, +47, +52 (TL1-5; SP 100)], to see through stealth by [+11, +14, +17, +20, +22 (TL1-5; SP 100)], and to perform a critical spell cast by [+6%, +8%, +10%, +11%, +13% (TL1-5; SP 100)].

The effects will improve with your Spellpower.
